                {
                  "start_index": 76,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "As I was just telling Professor Oak, scientists from my ",
                    "home region have noticed odd readings on Mt. Silver."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 79,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "As you approach the summit, it appears that the laws of ",
                    "physics start to behave strangely. "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 82,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Time slows down and objects seem to be pulled inwards as ",
                    "if they were about to get sucked into a black hole."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 85,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The scientists say that such a strange phenomenon could ",
                    "only be caused by a significant distortion in spacetime. "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 88,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But the patterns are too irregular for it to be from natural ",
                    "causes. It's as if space and time were being deliberately ",
                    "manipulated by something..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 93,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Of course there's only so much information we can obtain ",
                    "from instrument readings. That's why I came here to check ",
                    "it out in person!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 97,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "There are myths in the Sinnoh region that describe two ",
                    "legendary Pokémon that are able to alter the spatial and ",
                    "temporal dimensions respectively."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 101,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But manipulating both time and space at once... That's ",
                    "unheard of! "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 104,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Since we might be dealing with something powerful, I asked ",
                    "\\V[12] to come join me on my expedition to Mt. Silver."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 109,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "If it's a Pokémon, then I'm gonna catch it and I'll be ",
                    "unbeatable!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 112,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN, would you like to join us? We do not know what we're ",
                    "up against so we could always use an experienced ",
                    "Pokémon trainer such as yourself."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 115,
                  "type": "choices",
                  "choices": [
                    "Yes",
                    "No"
                  ],
                  "cancel_type": 2
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 118,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Great! You can come and meet us near the entrance to Mt. ",
                    "Silver so we can plan the expedition! "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 121,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It's a long trek to the top of the mountain so we should ",
                    "leave now."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 126,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Thank you very much, professor."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 130,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\V[12], \\PN, let's meet up at the base of Mt. Silver!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 134,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Oh... That's disappointing. But of course, as a League ",
                    "Champion myself, I completely understand that you are ",
                    "very busy."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 140,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It's a long trek to the top of the mountain so we ",
