                  "start_index": 55,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Let me introduce you to Mewtwo."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 57,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "This Pokémon was genetically engineered to be a ",
                    "pure killing machine."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 63,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "...Which brings us to the third surprise I have in ",
                    "store for you."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 70,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "<fs=38><b>Not so fast!</b></fs>"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 86,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Lance... I should've known you were a part of this."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 90,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "What you are doing is deplorable. Kidnapping the legendary ",
                    "Pokémon... We're here to put an end to this!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 94,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Hmm... It doesn't matter. Champion or not, you don't stand a ",
                    "chance against Team Rocket."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 101,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Do as we've discussed earlier."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 103,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But sir, this isn't a regular fusion. It could be unstable. We ",
                    "shouldn't have it fight just yet!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 106,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Do as I say! This is an order."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 108,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Yes sir..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 143,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Good. Now let's get this over with once and for all."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {
                "self_switch": "A"
              },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "How... How could you..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 26,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Uh? Boss, the birds are acting up!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 52,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "What!?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 54,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "They... unfused by themselves!? How is this possible?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 102,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "No!!!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 134,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Articuno! Zapdos! Moltres! Mewtwo! Come back!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 144,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Tell everyone we're leaving."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 146,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "We need to chase after the legendary Pokémon and get ",
                    "them back. "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 149,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "This is priority number one!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 159,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN... You haven't seen the last of Team Rocket!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 167,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Phew! This was a close one."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 169,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I better not lose any time and chase after them right away."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 171,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Farewell, \\PN. We will meet again someday, I'm sure of it!"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
