                  ],
                  "cancel_type": 2
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 17,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Wild Ditto can sometimes be found holding Quick Powder. ",
                    "You can probably find them in the basement of the ",
                    "Pokémon Mansion."
                  ]
                },
