                  "lines": [
                    "The Giant Chasm!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 32,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "This is the spot where Kyurem's power resonates."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 34,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Here, Kyurem can use the full extent of its power and ",
                    "easily cover all of Unova in ice!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 46,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Kyrem, come!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 53,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Haaahraaan!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 56,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I have a memory that has continued to haunt me.",
                    "Just one."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 59,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "That unpleasant look in your eyes reminds me of it."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 61,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "That aside, this is my gift to you to show my respect for ",
                    "making it this far."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 64,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I'll freeze you solid right here so you can watch my ",
                    "glorious ascent!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 67,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Kyurem! Glaciate!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 70,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Haaahraaan!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 74,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 78,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "So you came ..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 80,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The freak without a human heart... N!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 88,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Reshiram told me Kyurem is suffering!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 90,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I can't allow selfish humans to make Pokémon suffer!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 92,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "And I like Unova."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 94,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It's the place that taught me how to live as a human..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 96,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It's the place that made me notice the harmony between ",
                    "Pokémon and humans living together..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 99,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I will protect the Pokémon and humans who live here!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 102,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Bazazazzash!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 104,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Excellent, that was a moving expression of your ",
                    "determination!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 107,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "So the education I provided to make you king wasn't a ",
                    "complete waste, then!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 110,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But I still haven't forgotten that even though I was kind ",
                    "enough to find you when you were living in the forest with ",
                    "Pokémon, and take you in, and care for you, in the end you ",
                    "were selfish and disrupted my plans."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 115,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I was supposed to use your abilities to rule Unova!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 122,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But I'll forgive you for that as well."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 124,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Reshiram, which you were kind enough to bring with you, ",
                    "can melt ice!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 127,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Now you've saved me the work of searching for it!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 129,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Well actually, I knew you'd appear if we fired ice missiles ",
                    "into Opelucid City and you noticed the change!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 132,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "That's an ugly formula!",
                    "It won't work!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 135,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Oh, but it will!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 137,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "If I use these!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 139,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The DNA Splicers!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 164,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Purrloin! Noooooo!"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
