                  "start_index": 36,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Zapdos..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 38,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "And Moltres..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 43,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "They are the three most powerful Pokémon in the ",
                    "Kanto region."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 52,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "...Which brings us to the surprise I have in ",
                    "store for you."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 59,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Do as we've discussed earlier."
                  ]
                },
