            "0": {
              "conditions": {
              },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 10,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Hello, my name is Professor Elm. Oh, and you must be ",
                    "\\PN!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 13,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "My colleague Professor Oak had some great things to say ",
                    "about you!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 18,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "As Professor Oak may have told you, I have recently ",
                    "acquired some intel about the whereabouts of the ",
                    "legendary Pokémon Mewtwo."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 22,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But before I tell you about Mewtwo, I need to make sure I ",
                    "can trust you."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 25,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I'll tell you all about Mewtwo if you can show me 2 badges ",
                    "from the Johto region."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 29,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "That's it! Authentic Johto badges. Professor Oak certainly ",
                    "didn't lie about your credentials!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 32,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You truly are a Pokémon master. I'm sorry for doubting you!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 35,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Very well. As I was saying, I have some information about ",
                    "the legendary Pokémon Mewtwo."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 38,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "All of my research indicated that it is hiding inside of",
                    "Cerulean Cave in Kanto."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 42,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The cave's entrance is up a Waterfall, so you'll need to ",
                    "teach the HM to one your Pokémon in order to reach ",
                    "it."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 48,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The cave's entrance is up a Waterfall, so you'll need to ",
                    "teach this technique to one your Pokémon in order to reach ",
                    "it."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 56,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I have no idea what kind of Pokémon you'll face in there, ",
                    "but I expect them to be very strong. So come prepared!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 59,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Good luck to you!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 63,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Oh! And before you leave, you can take one of the three ",
                    "Pokémon on the table."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 66,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "These are the three starter Pokémon we give to new ",
                    "trainers here in the Johto region."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 69,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "They're all very rare, so choose wisely!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 76,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "...Oh, that's no good. You're missing some badges."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 78,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Not to be rude, but I'd rather keep the information to ",
                    "myself until you can show me 2 Johto badges."
                  ]
                },
