    "378": {
      "name": "Mewtwo Intro",
      "events": {
        "17": {
          "name": "Giovanni",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 7,
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {
              },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 16,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "What you have before your eyes is the most powerful ",
                    "Pokémon in existence."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 21,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "This is Mewtwo."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 23,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "We have engineered Mewtwo by cloning the DNA of Mew, ",
                    "the ancestor of all Pokémon into a new, more powerful body."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 26,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Impressive, isn't it Professor?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 28,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Impressive indeed. "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 30,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I take it this is related to the controversial experiments on ",
                    "Pokémon fusion you've been conducting."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 33,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Oh, these were more than just experiments, believe me."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 35,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "We, Team Rocket, are planning to revolutionize the world ",
                    "with Pokémon fusion."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 39,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But Giovanni... "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 41,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Have you considered the ethical implications ",
                    "of such experiments?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 44,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "When two Pokémon are fused together, are they still the ",
                    "same Pokémon as they were before?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 47,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Do both of their personalities coexist in the same body or ",
                    "does one of them take over?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 50,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Pokémon are sentient beings, you cannot just ",
                    "force two beings into a single body."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 54,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "<b><fs=40>Boss!!!</fs></b>"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 66,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Boss, there's an intruder in the lab! "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 68,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "What? What do you mean an intruder?!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 70,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "He keeps defeating all of our Pokémon! There's nothing we ",
                    "can do!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 79,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Mr. Fuji? What are you doing here?!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 82,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I'm here to put an end to this!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 87,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Team Rocket has created a virus that causes Pokémon to ",
                    "fuse with each other against their will!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 90,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It's highly contagious and they want to use the Cinnabar ",
                    "volcano to spread it around the Kanto region!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 96,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Is this true, Giovanni? "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 98,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Why would you want to do such a thing?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 103,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Well, it looks like our plans have been discovered."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 109,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "If we release this virus into the wild, the economy of the ",
                    "region will thrive."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 112,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Kanto would become renowned for its incredible diversity of ",
                    "Pokémon and trainers from all around the world would come ",
                    "here."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 116,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Which of course would be great for Team Rocket's ",
                    "business."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 123,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I can release the virus right now at the press of only a few ",
                    "buttons on this very machine."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 136,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I have to agree with Mr. Fuji here, Giovanni."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 138,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "This is absolutely insane and completely irresponsible! We ",
                    "cannot let you do that!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 141,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Oh, is that so Professor?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 143,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Well in that case..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 147,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Why don't you give our guests here a taste of what's to ",
                    "come?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 156,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "How annoying."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 158,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Though I have to admit, those are some impressive battling ",
                    "skills for two old men."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 161,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But now let's get this over with."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 166,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Mewtwo, won't you please come greet our guests."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 175,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "How..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 177,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "How could it be?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 179,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It looks like you were able to stop me..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 181,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I must admit, I really did not see it coming."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 183,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Still, I might not have been able to spread the virus around ",
                    "the region, but we plan on marketing DNA Splicers and ",
                    "making them easily available for all trainers."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 187,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Pokémon fusion is still about to become reality ",
                    "nonetheless!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 206,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "So, what did you think of Mewtwo? Powerful, isn't it?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 214,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "So, are you impressed, professor?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 216,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Hmm..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 224,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I will now go on with the plan and use Cinnabar Island's ",
                    "volcano to release the virus."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 235,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Soon fused Pokemon will be found ",
                    "everywhere. "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 238,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "And there's absolutely nothing that you two old men can do ",
                    "about it now!"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
