                  "start_index": 31,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I take it this is related to the controversial experiments on ",
                    "Pokémon fusion you've been conducting."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 34,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Oh, these were more than just experiments, believe me."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 36,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "We, Team Rocket, are planning to revolutionize the world ",
                    "with Pokémon fusion."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 40,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But Giovanni... "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 42,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Have you considered the ethical implications ",
                    "of such experiments?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 45,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "When two Pokémon are fused together, are they still the ",
                    "same Pokémon as they were before?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 48,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Do both of their personalities coexist in the same body or ",
                    "does one of them take over?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 51,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Pokémon are sentient beings, you cannot just ",
                    "force two of them into a single body."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 55,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "<b><fs=40>Boss!!!</fs></b>"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 67,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Boss, there's an intruder in the lab! "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 69,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "What? What do you mean an intruder?!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 71,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "He keeps defeating all of our Pokémon! There's nothing we ",
                    "can do!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 80,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Mr. Fuji? What are you doing here?!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 83,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I'm here to put an end to this!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 88,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Team Rocket has created a virus that causes Pokémon to ",
                    "fuse with each other against their will!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 91,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It's highly contagious and they want to use the Cinnabar ",
                    "volcano to spread it around the Kanto region!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 97,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Is this true, Giovanni? "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 99,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Why would you want to do such a thing?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 104,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Well, it looks like our secret plan has been unveiled."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 122,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "...It doesn't matter. I can release the virus right now at the ",
                    "press of only a few buttons on this very machine."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 135,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "This is crazy! We cannot let you do that!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 137,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Oh, is that so Professor?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 139,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Well in that case..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 143,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Let's get this over with."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 148,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Mewtwo, won't you please come greet our guests."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 161,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "How..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 163,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "How could it be?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 165,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It looks like you were able to stop me..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 167,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I must admit, I really did not see it coming."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 173,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Still, I might not have been able to spread the virus around ",
                    "the region, but we plan on marketing DNA Splicers and ",
                    "making them easily available for all trainers."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 177,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Pokémon fusion is still about to become a reality ",
                    "nonetheless!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 180,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Just... Perhaps not to the extent of what it could have ",
                    "been."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 205,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I will now go on with the plan and use Cinnabar Island's ",
