                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Some days ago, some of our scientists discovered some ",
                    "fossilized resin in Viridian Forest that might contain the ",
                    "DNA of a prehistoric Pokémon!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 7,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But when I went back with the excavating team, the site ",
                    "had been completely taken over by a Beedrill's nest and it's ",
                    "impossible to go anywhere near it!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 11,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I see you're a Pokémon trainer, so could you please help me ",
                    "to get rid of the Beedrills?"
