              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 14,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I finished the premilinary analysis on the Old Amber we ",
                    "discovered."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 17,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The good news is that it does contain the DNA of a ",
                    "rare prehistoric Pokémon."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 20,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But unfortunately, our equipment here at the museum isn't ",
                    "sophisticated enough to revive it. "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 23,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The only laboratory that has a fossil-",
                    "regenerating machine that is sophisticated enough to ",
                    "extract DNA from amber is located on Cinnabar Island."
