              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 7,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Hey, \\PN! What brings you here?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 9,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Your Pokémon don't look dead!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 11,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I can at least make them faint! Let's go, pal!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 41,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "How's your Pokédex coming, pal? I just caught a Haunter!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 43,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I'm going to try to fuse it with another Pokémon and see ",
                    "if I can evolve it!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 46,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Well, I better get going! I've got a lot to..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 50,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "<fs=38><b>Tell us, old man! Or we're going to have to hurt ",
                    "you!</b></fs>"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 65,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "What was that all about?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 67,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I guess I'll stick around a bit longer after all."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 69,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Come on, let's go check it out!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 108,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Come on, tell us how to make the Master Ball!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 110,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You were working at Silph Co. when it was being ",
                    "developed. We know you have the plans!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 121,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Hey! You!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 123,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "What are you looking at?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 125,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You both better go away right now or we'll have to hurt you ",
                    "too!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 131,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Just wait here a bit, Mr. Fuji. "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 133,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "We'll deal with these trouble makers and we'll be right back ",
                    "to you!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 159,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Well this sure is embarrassing..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 171,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Good news!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 184,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "We just found the last remaining Master Ball prototype!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 186,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "This changes everything!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 188,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "With a working prototype, we'll be easily able to copy it and ",
                    "mass-produce it! "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 193,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Looks like we'll no longer be needing you old man!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 195,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Let's head to Celadon City right away!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 213,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Wow, I cannot thank you enough!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 215,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "My name is Mr. Fuji. I used to be a scientist at Silph Co. ",
                    "when we were working on the Master Ball Project."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 218,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Nowadays I spend my days caring for orphaned Pokémon at ",
                    "the Pokémon house, here in Lavender Town."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 221,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I don't know what those Team Rocket people wanted to do ",
                    "with the Master Ball, but it can't be good."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 224,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Please, follow them to Celadon City and take back that ",
                    "Master Ball prototype of theirs."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 227,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "We can't let a criminal organization have such a powerful ",
                    "tool in their hands!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 230,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Sounds good to me."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 232,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I was already heading to Celadon City to get my fourth Gym ",
                    "badge anyway, so I'll see what I can do!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 237,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You should head there too, \\PN!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 239,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Smell ya later!"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
