    "490": {
      "name": "Route 3",
      "events": {
        "16": {
          "name": "brock-rematch",
          "x": 63,
          "y": 7,
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {
                "switch1_id": 12,
                "switch2_id": 14
              },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Hello, \\PN. Mt. Moon looks very majestic at this time of ",
                    "the day, don't you agree?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I like to come here to admire the rock formations whenever ",
                    "I have some free time."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 7,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I still remember that battle we had a while back. You were ",
                    "only a beginning trainer but I could already sense the ",
                    "determination in your eyes."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 11,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But you've become incredibly strong since then. "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 13,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Meet me at the Battle Arena in Vermillion City if you want ",
                    "to battle me again. I'll be waiting for you!"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "27": {
          "name": "oak assistant",
          "x": 6,
          "y": 11,
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {
                "switch1_id": 4
              },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 8,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 19,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It's me, Prof. Oak's assistant!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 21,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I was doing some field work around here and I came across ",
                    "something incredible. You've really got to see this!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 59,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It seems like there's an outbreak of wild Pokémon with ",
                    "<b>Hidden Abilities</b> on this route!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 65,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I saw one of them in this very patch of grass!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 69,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You'll be able to tell at the start of battle if a Pokémon has ",
                    "its hidden ability."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 75,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "This is a very rare event. We're lucky to be witnessing it ",
                    "so close to home!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 78,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But I don't expect it to last for a very long time either so ",
                    "you should try to catch one of these rare Pokémon while ",
                    "you still have the chance!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 83,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Well I'm headed to Cerulean City for some field work so I ",
                    "better get going."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 86,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It's right on the other side of Mt. Moon, maybe I'll catch you ",
                    "there. Good luck with your Pokémon League challenge!"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "11": {
          "name": "Trainer(4)",
