        "33": {
          "name": "brock2",
          "x": 72,
          "y": 8,
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {
                "switch1_id": 677
              },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "We need to go investigate who's behind all of these ",
                    "attacks and learn what they're after."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Please go inside the cave and come back to me if you find",
                    "out anything."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {
                "switch1_id": 679
              },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "So \\PN, did you find out anything about who was bullying ",
                    "all these trainers in there?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "choices",
                  "choices": [
                    "Some thugs dressed in black...",
                    "I didn't see anything"
                  ],
                  "cancel_type": 0
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 6,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Some thugs dressed in black? Hmm.. this sounds just like ",
                    "the works of Team Rocket."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 9,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "They're a local group of Pokémon gangsters. But they ",
                    "usually stick to petty crimes. It's worrying to see them ",
                    "being so bold as to attack Pokémon trainers."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 15,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "That's unfortunate. What's sure is that whoever did this ",
                    "were more than just your average thugs."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 18,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It seemed as though this was all part of a coordinated plan. ",
                    "They must have some kind of ulterior motive."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 24,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Oh, so the path was blocked by a boulder? I might be able ",
                    "to help with that."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 28,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "This move allows your Pokémon to pulverize boulders that ",
                    "are in the way to clear the path."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 31,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "All rocks are precious to me, so I don't like using this ",
                    "move. But it's invaluable to the excavators who work for ",
                    "the museum."
                  ]
                },
