    "519": {
      "name": "Azalea Town",
      "events": {
        "1": {
          "name": "EV001",
          "x": 15,
          "y": 17,
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {
              },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "There were rumors of a legendary Water-type Pokémon ",
                    "that had been sighted near Azalea Town."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 3,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "So naturally I went there looking for it."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I flooded the well because I knew that the ",
                    "water would attract it."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 6,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I waited and waited and waited. Until eventually it showed ",
                    "up during a violent thunderstorm."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 10,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "There it was, Suicune... The legendary Pokémon."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 11,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But the thunderstorm had also attracted another visitor."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 14,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Raikou, another one of the legendary beast Pokémon had ",
                    "also showed up alongside Suicune!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 20,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I knew that I did not have much time, so I had to think ",
                    "fast."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 22,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I instinctively threw a pair of DNA Splicers in the water."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 27,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It did what it was supposed to do, but unfortunately, this ",
                    "caused my creation to flee."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 41,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I waited for it to come back, but it never did..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 42,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Then one day, I heard that a legendary Pokémon had been ",
                    "sighted near the Ruins of Alph, so I went there to track it ",
                    "down."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 45,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But it seems you were faster than I."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
