            "7": {
              "conditions": {
                "switch1_id": 220
              },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Oh \\PN! How is my old Pokémon doing?",
                    "Well, it seems to like you a lot."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "What? You have something for me?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN delivered Oak's Parcel."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 8,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Ah! This is the custom PokéBall I ordered! Thank you!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 11,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "And I can see they gave you some DNA Splicers as well. ",
                    "How convenient since you've just become a trainer!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 14,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But of course, you'll need a second Pokémon before you ",
                    "can use it."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 17,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Here, I'll give you some Poké Balls so you can catch some ",
                    "Pokémon to try it on!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 20,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You can always defuse your Pokémon if you don't like the ",
                    "result, but it will lose some experience in the process."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 26,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Oh and did you get some DNA Splicers while you were ",
                    "there as well?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 29,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You didn't? Oh, that's no problem.",
                    "You can always return to buy some later!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 34,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "There's also another thing."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 41,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I forgot to give you your Pokédex before you headed out ",
                    "earlier!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 46,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN obtained the Pokédex!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 48,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I already gave my grandson his before he left."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 50,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The Pokédex automatically records data on Pokémon ",
                    "you've seen or caught! It's a hi-tech encyclopedia!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 53,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "There are now over 200,000 species of Pokémon thanks to ",
                    "Pokémon Fusion, so I cannot possibly expect you ",
                    "to complete it."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 57,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But you should still try to catch as many different  species ",
                    "as you can!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 62,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Now go! Your journey to the Pokémon League starts now!"
