    "591": {
      "name": "Sinjoh Ruins",
      "events": {
        "5": {
          "name": "EV005",
          "x": 9,
          "y": 8,
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {
              },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "A long time ago, people used to draw life from Pokémon ",
                    "and also give their lives to those Pokémon..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "That shows that people and Pokémon used to be more ",
                    "closely bonded with each other."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 7,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "When people moved from place to place, the myths and ",
                    "legends of Pokémon and their power would also be carried ",
                    "with those people."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 11,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "That's how myths and legends from each region are ",
                    "blended with each other."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 14,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The ancient ruins here have inherited the legends from ",
                    "both the Ruins of Alph in Johto and the Spear Pillar in ",
                    "Sinnoh."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 18,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "That is proof that the people from Johto and Sinnoh ",
                    "blended together as a group."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "4": {
          "name": "EV004",
          "x": 12,
          "y": 8,
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {
              },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 2,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN! I did not expect to find you here. It is good to see you ",
                    "again."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 7,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "My name is Cynthia. I am a Pokémon trainer."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 11,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The Sinjoh ruins remind me of Sinnoh, where I come from."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 13,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Initially, I thought it was because it snows a lot here as ",
                    "well."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 16,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But that was not it."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 18,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "A long time ago... people came from Sinnoh to live here."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 20,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "They must have built a temple while longing for home."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 22,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "That's why we call these the Sinjoh ruins..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 27,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You are..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 29,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "A Pokémon trainer?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 31,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "This Pokémon behind you... I can sense a familiar ",
                    "presence... "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 34,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The power of Dialga... Palkia... Or could it be Giratina?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 36,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It's similar, but not quite the same..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 38,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Could it be.... Arceus?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 41,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Can you come to the Sinjoh ruins with me?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 43,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "And bring Arceus with you..."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
