              },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Oh \\PN! How is my old Pokémon doing?",
                    "Well, it seems to like you a lot."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "What? You have something for me?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN delivered Oak's Parcel."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 8,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Ah! This is the custom PokéBall I ordered! Thank you!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 11,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "And I can see they gave you some DNA Splicers as well. ",
                    "How convenient since you've just become a trainer!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 14,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But of course, you'll need a second Pokémon before you ",
                    "can use it."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 17,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Here, I'll give you some Poké Balls so you can catch some ",
                    "Pokémon to try it on!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 20,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You can always defuse your Pokémon if you don't like the ",
                    "result, but it will lose some experience in the process."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 26,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Oh and did you get some DNA Splicers while you were ",
                    "there as well?"
