    "803": {
      "name": "Saffron City",
      "events": {
        "5": {
          "name": "sabrina",
          "x": 11,
          "y": 6,
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {
                "switch1_id": 701,
                "switch2_id": 719
              },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "So the cause of this sudden darkness might be a psychic ",
                    "Pokémon... "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Yes, this makes a lot of sense. But where could it be ",
                    "hiding?"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        "4": {
          "name": "EV004",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 7,
          "pages": {
            "0": {
              "conditions": {
              },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Greetings, young one. Have you met my grand-daughter, ",
                    "Sabrina in the gym next door yet?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Sabrina's mother and I, we used to watch her grow amidst ",
                    "the peaceful aura of this place. The bond she shares with ",
                    "the spirits, it's a gift and a responsibility. "
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "1": {
              "conditions": {
                "switch1_id": 701
              },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Ah, welcome, dear traveler. I see you're one of the brave ",
                    "souls seeking answers to the encroaching darkness."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 4,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Sabrina's told you about our connection to the hidden ",
                    "dimension, hasn't she? I can share a bit more with you, if ",
                    "you're willing to listen."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 7,
                  "type": "choices",
                  "choices": [
                    "Yes",
                    "No"
                  ],
                  "cancel_type": 2
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 10,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You see, there's a realm unseen, a dimension where ",
                    "thoughts, dreams, and consciousness intertwine. "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 13,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Every living being, humans and Pokémon alike, sends and ",
                    "receives messages through this ethereal channel. Yet, ",
                    "these messages seldom reach our conscious minds; they're ",
                    "felt as intuition or inspiration."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 18,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "This dimension is a thread that binds all alternate ",
                    "universes together."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 20,
                  "type": "choices",
                  "choices": [
                    "Go on",
                    "That's enough"
                  ],
                  "cancel_type": 2
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 23,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Now, Psychic Pokémon possess a rare gift-they can ",
                    "consciously interact with this dimension. This is what ",
                    "allows them to control minds and send telepathic ",
                    "messages."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 28,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "My family, including my granddaughter Sabrina, is among ",
                    "those born with this remarkable ability."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 31,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Sabrina and I share this connection across time and space. ",
                    "We've used it to communicate, even to speak with another ",
                    "gifted individual from another world. "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 35,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "That someone lived in a place called \\C[1]Ultra ",
                    "Megalopolis\\C[0]. Much like Sabrina, they possessed the ",
                    "power to emit messages through our shared dimension. "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 39,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But it has been a long time since they last attempted to ",
                    "communicate..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 42,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "They spoke of a calamity that befell their world-a ",
                    "malevolent presence called \\C[1]Necrozma",
                    "\\C[0]."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 46,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "This sinister being arrived, swallowing light and plunging ",
                    "their world into an endless night. The very essence of their ",
                    "existence was drained, leaving naught but darkness behind. "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 51,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I fear, dear traveler, that the same dark fate threatens our ",
                    "Kanto. \\C[1]Necrozma\\C[0]'s reach knows no bounds, ",
                    "spanning across universes to cast its shadow."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 55,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Please, for the sake of our worlds and all that inhabit them, ",
                    "put an end to this menace. Our hopes, our minds, and our ",
                    "strength are with you on this perilous journey."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 61,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Very well then."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 63,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I fear that the light may never return to our region. Just ",
                    "like what happened that city from the other world..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 70,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Very well then."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "2": {
              "conditions": {
                "switch1_id": 708
              },
              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Truly, your courage has pierced the darkness that sought ",
                    "to envelop our world. Light and hope have returned, and ",
                    "Saffron City once again pulses with vibrant energy. "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 5,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Your actions have bridged the gap between realms, ",
                    "showing us the strength of bonds forged in the face of ",
                    "adversity. "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 9,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The echoes of gratitude reverberate through this city, and I ",
                    "offer my heartfelt thanks for your role in this momentous ",
                    "triumph."
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      }
