              "dialogue_blocks": [
                {
                  "start_index": 10,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Cynthia... If what you are saying is true, then it could only ",
                    "be caused by an immensely powerful Pokémon."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 15,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I have studied the Sinnoh myths extensively and I believe ",
                    "that there exist Pokémon that could excert this sort of ",
                    "power. "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 19,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But this begs the question: Why Mt. Silver, of all ",
                    "places?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 31,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Ah, \\PN! I didn't hear you come in. It is good to see you!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 33,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "This is Cynthia. She came all the way from the Sinnoh ",
                    "region to share a very interesting discovery with us."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 40,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN... Yes! I remember you from the Sinjoh Ruins. It's good ",
                    "to see you again."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 45,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN... I am pleased to meet you!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 50,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "So \\PN, you got all the Johto badges too, huh? You really ",
                    "can't get enough, can't you?"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 53,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I figured you were something special when you beat me at ",
                    "the Pokémon League, but to think you'd get all the badges ",
                    "from Johto too... This is just something else!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 57,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "There are very few trainers who can claim to have so ",
                    "many badges. It is quite the achievement. Congratulations, ",
                    "\\PN!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 61,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Cynthia's a League Champion just like you, you know? If ",
                    "you're looking for one final opponent to test your skills ",
                    "against, then she's probably it!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 65,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "One day, we might get the chance to face off against each ",
                    "other, but for now we have more pressing matters."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 68,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Yes, of course... Go on."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 76,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "As I was just telling Professor Oak, scientists from my ",
                    "home region have noticed odd readings on Mt. Silver."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 79,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "As you approach the summit, it appears that the laws of ",
                    "physics start to behave strangely. "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 82,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Time slows down and objects seem to be pulled inwards as ",
                    "if they were about to get sucked into a black hole."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 85,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "The scientists say that such a strange phenomenon could ",
                    "only be caused by a significant distortion in spacetime. "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 88,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But the patterns are too irregular for it to be from natural ",
                    "causes. It's as if space and time were being deliberately ",
                    "manipulated by something..."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 93,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Of course there's only so much information we can obtain ",
                    "from instrument readings. That's why I came here to check ",
                    "it out in person!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 97,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "There are myths in the Sinnoh region that describe two ",
                    "legendary Pokémon that are able to alter the spatial and ",
                    "temporal dimensions respectively."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 101,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "But manipulating both time and space at once... That's ",
                    "unheard of! "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 104,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Since we might be dealing with something powerful, I asked ",
                    "\\V[12] to come join me on my expedition to Mt. Silver."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 109,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "If it's a Pokémon, then I'm gonna catch it and I'll be ",
                    "unbeatable!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 112,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\PN, would you like to join us? We do not know what we're ",
                    "up against so we could always use an experienced ",
                    "Pokémon trainer such as yourself."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 115,
                  "type": "choices",
                  "choices": [
                    "Yes",
                    "No"
                  ],
                  "cancel_type": 2
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 118,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Great! You can come and meet us near the entrance to Mt. ",
                    "Silver so we can plan the expedition! "
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 121,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It's a long trek to the top of the mountain so we should ",
                    "leave now."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 126,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Thank you very much, professor."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 130,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "\\V[12], \\PN, let's meet up at the base of Mt. Silver!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 134,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "Oh... That's disappointing. But of course, as a League ",
                    "Champion myself, I completely understand that you are ",
                    "very busy."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 140,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "It's a long trek to the top of the mountain so we ",
