          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 15,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "You strike me as someone who can be a bit mean-spirited ",
            "sometimes, but still generally well-intentioned."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 25,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "You strike me as  a very neutral person. Neither good, nor ",
            "bad."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 32,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "You seem like you're very pure of heart and always willing ",
            "to help the ones in need."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 38,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "You strike me as someone who tries its earnest to always ",
            "do the right thing."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 44,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "You strike me as someone who generally tries to do the ",
            "right thing, but you could also do a bit more."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 49,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "You strike me as someone who generally tries to do the ",
            "right thing, but your heart isn't completely pure either."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 60,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Spread kindness around you and the universe will be kind ",
            "to you in return."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "50": {
      "name": "oak - postgame",
      "trigger": 0,
      "switch_id": 1,
      "dialogue_blocks": [
        {
          "start_index": 1,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "If it isn't the new Pokémon League Champion! Welcome ",
            "home \\PN, it's good to have you back."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 4,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Everyone in the Pokémon scientific community is very ",
            "impressed by your achievement."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 7,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "I have been talking with my colleague from the Johto ",
            "region, professor Elm and told me that he wanted to give ",
            "you a Pokémon to commemorate your victory."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 12,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "He also mentionned something else..."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 14,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "A long time ago, scientists from Cinnabar Island ",
            "engineered a Pokémon more powerful than any others."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 17,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "But they failed to curb its vicious tendencies and one day, ",
            "it fled the mansion and hasn't been seen ever since."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 20,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Recently, my colleague Professor Elm in Johto came ",
            "across some new information concerning this rare ",
            "Pokémon's whereabouts."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 24,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "He says he'd need the assistance of a strong trainer, so I ",
            "thought you'd be the perfect candidate."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 27,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "His lab is located in New Bark Town in the Johto region. ",
            "It's a long way from here, but do you think you could pay ",
            "him a visit?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 31,
          "type": "choices",
          "choices": [
            "Sure",
            "Not really..."
          ],
          "cancel_type": 2
        },
        {
          "start_index": 37,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Please! Professor Elm would greatly benefit from the ",
            "field experience of a powerful trainer like yourself."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 40,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Won't you please reconsider?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 46,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Great! Then it's settled. Go meet my colleague Professor ",
            "Elm in New Bark Town."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 49,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "You can get to Johto by taking the train from Saffron City."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 51,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "When you're in Goldenrod City, head down South through ",
            "Azalea Town, and continue until you reach Violet City."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 54,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "From there, it should be a straight path to New Bark Town!"
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 55,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Professor Elm will give you further instructions when you ",
            "meet him. Good luck!"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
