      "dialogue_blocks": [
        {
          "start_index": 0,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Welcome to Pokémon Infinite Fusion! "
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 1,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Before we get started, could you tell us where you ",
            "downloaded the game from? (This data will not be ",
            "collected)."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 38,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Perfect! The game's official \\C[3]Discord\\C[0], the game's ",
            "official \\C[3]subreddit\\C[0]  and the game's \\C[3]",
            "Pokecommunity\\C[0] thread are the <b>only</b> safe ",
            "places to download the game."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 42,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Pokémon Infinite Fusion does NOT currently have an ",
            "official website, though this may change in the future."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 44,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "There have been multiple websites that reupload ",
            "the game and pretend to be official websites to steal users ",
            "information and we feel that it's important to inform the ",
            "players."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 49,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Let's get started!"
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 56,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "\\C[2]<b>IMPORTANT !!!</b>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 58,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "\\C[2]Pokémon Infinite Fusion does NOT currently ",
            "have an official website, though this may change in the ",
            "future."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 62,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "\\C[2]There are multiple websites that reupload the game ",
            "and pretend to be official websites to <b>steal your data ",
            "and infect your computer</b>."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 66,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "Here are the steps you need to take if you want to be safe:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 67,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "1. Uninstall the game from your computer, as well as ",
            "anything else you might have downloaded from the fake ",
            "website."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 70,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "2. Run a full virus scan of your computer."
          ]
        },
        {
          "start_index": 71,
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            "3. Join the game's Discord and redownload the game from ",
            "there."
          ]
        },
